# Google Gemini API key (server-only — never exposed to the browser).
# Get one from https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
# Use the PAID tier before any real user's photos are sent (see docs/spec.md
# §7/§10) — the free tier may train on uploaded images.
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Optional: override the model id (defaults to gemma-4-26b-a4b-it — free on
# Google AI Studio for dev/testing, verified working with image input). Its
# sibling gemma-4-31b-it does NOT work (fails consistently) — don't switch to
# that one. If the review call ever fails with code "image_input_unsupported",
# set this to gemini-2.5-flash instead, which reliably accepts images on every
# account regardless of Gemma's availability.
GEMINI_MODEL=

# --- Phase 2 (not wired up yet) ---
# Supabase project URL + anon key, once auth/db/storage are built per docs/spec.md §5a.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
